    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Happy Ours at Camp Creek — 3 Bedroom Cottage with Pool and Deeded Beach Access<br><br>Step into a sunny, coastal retreat at Happy Ours, a 3 bedroom, 2 bath cottage in the heart of Camp Creek, Seacrest Beach. Ideal for families or groups of friends, this cottage comfortably sleeps six and combines beach-inspired charm with thoughtful touches for a fun and relaxing vacation. Just a short walk from private deeded beach access, guests can enjoy the Gulf’s emerald waters and sugar-white sands anytime they like.<br><br>Your Space<br>The open living area is designed for connection, with comfortable seating and a large flat screen TV, perfect for movie nights or unwinding after a day outdoors. The fully equipped kitchen features stainless steel appliances, an island with seating for four, and both a standard drip and Keurig coffee maker, making breakfast or meal prep easy and enjoyable. Adjacent to the kitchen, a dining area for four provides the perfect spot for shared meals or games.<br><br>For added convenience, the cottage also includes a washer and dryer, making it easy to refresh beachwear after a day in the sand. Step outside to the covered back deck overlooking the community pool and hot tub, a great spot for morning coffee, sunset cocktails, or casual conversations with friends and family.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>Primary Bedroom: Queen bed, TV, private bathroom with large walk-in shower, and direct access to the back deck.<br>Guest Bedroom 1: Queen bed with TV, shares the hall bathroom.<br>Guest Bedroom 2: Two twin beds, perfect for kids or friends.<br><br>At Happy Ours, you’ll enjoy full access to:<br>- Sparkling community pool<br>- Relaxing hot tub<br>- Paved paths for walking or biking within Camp Creek<br>- A short walk to private beach access<br><br>Local Experiences<br>From this cottage, the best of 30A is within reach:<br>- Stroll or bike along Scenic Hwy 30A and 30Avenue to enjoy local dining, boutique shopping, and charming cafés.<br>- Visit Rosemary Beach or Seaside for unique architecture, local art, and family-friendly attractions.<br>- Enjoy beach days, shelling, or watching stunning Gulf sunsets just minutes from your door.<br><br>Your stay at Happy Ours at Camp Creek comes with Xplorie’s best activities! one ticket per day, per activity! (over $800 in nightly value) Tee off at Emerald Bay or Regatta Bay, zip through Baytowne Adventure Zone, and sail on the Sea Blaster Dolphin Cruise. Enjoy Big Kahuna’s Water Park, Black Light Mini Golf, and scenic bike rides with complimentary rentals. Explore 30A with ease and adventure!<br><br>Other Things to Note:<br>* Snowbird Friendly!<br>* Sorry, no pets allowed.<br>* Parking for 2 cars.<br><br>A Benchmark initial starter kit of amenities are provided for all guests. For the kitchen this includes: 1 roll of paper towels, 1 dish sponge, 1 dish soap, 2 dishwasher pods, and 1 liner for each trashcan. For each bathroom it includes: 1 roll of toilet paper, 1 set of soap/body wash/shampoo/conditioner/lotion. For towels you will receive: 1 body towel/1 washcloth per guest and 2 hand towels per bathroom, plus 2 washing machine pods.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Seacrest 3BR Cottage at Camp Creek – Pool, Hot tub & Beach Nearby!"
        }
      ],
